# Build output. Each tool's dist/ is produced by its Build-*.ps1 (PS2EXE) and is
# NOT tracked: committed binaries silently went stale against their sources
# (MaterialsInstaller ~10KB behind, TypeCatalogConverter ~22KB behind) and users
# running them got old behavior with no indication. Non-developers should launch
# the .bat in each tool folder — it runs the source .ps1 directly, so it is
# always current. See each tool's README.
dist/
